<title>UK: EBRD adds 1.0 bln rand to 20-year zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>EBRD adds 1.0 bln rand to 20-year zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    07.APR.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  8.30	PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    8.05	SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH THE OUTSTANDING 4.5 BILLION RAND DEAL</p>
<p>DUE</p>
<p>		APRIL, 7, 2017.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
